===Verb===
'''zoning'''
# {{present participle of|zone}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

#{{legal}}:[[Legislative]] action, usually at the [[municipal]] level, that divides municipalities into [[districts]] for the purpose of [[regulating]] the use of private property and the construction of buildings within the zones established. Zoning is said to be part of the state '''''police power''''', and therefore must be for the furthering of the [[health]], [[morals]], [[safety]], or [[general welfare]] of the [[community]].

